<?xml version='1.0' encoding='utf-8'?>
<chapter xml:id="useful-links">
  <title>Useful Links</title>
  <p>Collection of useful mathematical resources and websites.</p>
  <p>
    <ul>
      <li>
        <p>
          <alert>
            <url href="https://www.gap-system.org/">GAP-A System for Computational Discrete Algebra</url>
          </alert>
        </p>
        <p>Provides tools for computational group theory.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          <alert>
            <url href="https://www.sagemath.org/">SageMath</url>
          </alert>
        </p>
        <p>A free open-source mathematics software system built on plenty of existing open-source mathematical packages through a common, Python-based language.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          <alert>
            <url href="https://github.com/oscar-system/Oscar.jl">Oscar.jl</url>
          </alert>
        </p>
        <p>An open-source computer algebra system written in Julia.</p>
      </li>
      <li>
        <p>
          <alert>
            <url href="https://adjectivesproject.org/?page=home">Adjectives Project</url>
          </alert>
        </p>
        <p>A searchable collection of examples, properties, and implications for schemes and morphisms in algebraic geometry.</p>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </p>
  <p>© 2026 Jie Fu. All rights reserved.</p>
</chapter>
